section(class="page-section page-section--cinematic has-glow" id="contact")

    div(class="section-inner")

        div(class="section-heading")
            p(class="section-eyebrow") Contact
            h2(class="section-title") Tell me what you're building — or where the project is stuck
            p(class="section-lead").
                Share a short overview and I'll reply with the most useful next step. No sales deck required.

        div(class="contact-grid")

            div(class="contact-panel")
                +contact-form()

            div(class="contact-aside")

                h2(class="contact-aside-title") What happens next

                +contact-expectations()

                p Prefer email? Write to me directly — I read every message.

                ul(class="contact-links")
                    li: a(href="mailto:marko@interactivesolutions.hr" data-analytics="contact_email") marko@interactivesolutions.hr
                    li: a(href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/markoaleric" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-analytics="contact_linkedin") LinkedIn
                    li: a(href="https://github.com/maleric2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-analytics="contact_github") GitHub
                    li: a(href="https://assetstore.unity.com/publishers/40273" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-analytics="contact_publisher") Unity Asset Store
                    li: a(href="/assets/images/global/_linked/_verbatim/CV_Marko_Aleric_EN.pdf" data-analytics="contact_cv") Download CV

                p(class="form-note").
                    Your details are used only to respond to this inquiry and are not shared with
                    third parties. See the #[a(href="/privacy/") privacy policy].